    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065720/extras/201c3e100e70b2e73c0836e3268ae599.poster.avif?t=1740983080\" width=620 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065720/extras/201c3e100e70b2e73c0836e3268ae599.webm?t=1740983080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065720/extras/201c3e100e70b2e73c0836e3268ae599.mp4?t=1740983080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Rhythm game? survival game?<br>&quot;LIFE IS NOT AUTO&quot; is more like a timing game.<br>Players manually control the character's organs to keep them alive and live a lifetime.<br>Life is fragile,  your little mistakes might causes the sickness or death very easily.<br>Let's control the organs one by one and make good choices every moment to make the character healthy and  live longer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065720/extras/b7a9565284898bc929da2718ba676c7e.webp?t=1740983080\" width=554 height=60 /></span><br>Don't let your fingers stop moving on the keyboard!<br>Keep the tension, feel the rhythm, and control your organs!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065720/extras/34fb6cf4a3b90a7f2a6b44dbf43dadf5.poster.avif?t=1740983080\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065720/extras/34fb6cf4a3b90a7f2a6b44dbf43dadf5.apng?t=1740983080\" class=\"bb_img\" width=347 height=177 /></picture></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/30657